{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44950","headline":"酬乌程杨明府华雨後小亭对月见呈 · 皎然","name":"酬乌程杨明府华雨後小亭对月见呈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜凉喜无讼，霁色摇闲情。\n暑退不因雨，陶家风自清。\n凝弦停片景，发咏静秋声。\n何事禅中隐，诗题忽记名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44950.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44950","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}